Pi-DOS: Match KMS surface modes to the rendered raster and guest refresh.

Keep pixel duplication in the renderer, prefer exact-size host modes at the
closest guest refresh, and log requested/presented sizes for CRT diagnosis.
Other SDL video backends retain their existing selection behavior.

--- a/src/gui/sdlmain.cpp
+++ b/src/gui/sdlmain.cpp
@@ -1785,6 +1785,7 @@
 
